---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy & cookies"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">A clear view</div><h1>Privacy & cookies.</h1><p>How this website handles information and respects your choices.</p></section><section class="page-section prose"><p class="notice">Website privacy draft. The site owner should review this notice and add their legal business identity and privacy contact before launch.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a message in your browser. It does not submit your details to a server, store them in a database or send them automatically. If you choose to send an email, its contents will be processed by the email services you use and by the recipient.</p><h2>Your display preference</h2><p>This site stores your selected light or dark theme in your browser’s local storage under the key “zp-theme”. You can remove it through your browser settings. It is not used to track you.</p><h2>Videos and external services</h2><p>YouTube videos are loaded only when you choose to load a player. The player uses YouTube’s privacy-enhanced domain, but loading or playing it connects your browser to Google services. Their privacy and cookie policies apply. You can browse the rest of the site without loading a video.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The website is designed to be hosted by Cloudflare. When deployed, the hosting provider may process technical request information such as IP addresses to deliver and protect the website. No analytics or advertising trackers have been added to this site.</p><h2>Questions about privacy</h2>{site.contactEmail ? <p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} style="text-decoration:underline">{site.contactEmail}</a> with privacy questions or requests.</p> : <p>Privacy contact details will be added before the website launches.</p>}</section></div></Layout>
